  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qRjo0h9.png\" width=\"822\" height=\"295\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">專為 Fabric 打造的現代化 Hypixel 風格幸運方塊模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組支援僅伺服器端運作，意味著玩家無需安裝此模組即可遊玩含有幸運方塊的伺服器。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FYkDhCe.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ebiQRVe.gif\" width=\"253\" height=\"132\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wcH30VD.gif\" width=\"200\" height=\"146\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zeAnXBy.gif\" width=\"107\" height=\"101\"></p><p>與 Apex Hosting 合作，點擊下方橫幅即可獲取伺服器：</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.apexminecrafthosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3548\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cardboardpowered.org/assets/apex-hosting-mobile.webp\" width=\"539\" height=\"91\"></a></p>",
